generatedCommentsNodes.comment:
**`toString()` reports the wrong class name:**
```java
@Override
public String toString() {
    return "PopDeliveryRecord{" + ...
}
```
The class is `PopConsumerRecord`, but `toString()` prints `"PopDeliveryRecord"`. This will be misleading in log output and debugging. Change to `"PopConsumerRecord{"`.

